COMMENTS:
    COMMENTS are decleard using #.
    block COMMENTS are decleared using ## at the beginning and at the end.
        e.g ## this is an example of comments ##
VARIABLES:
    all VARIABLES are decleared like this:
        variable_name = value.
STATEMENTS:
    every STATEMENTS should end with .
CONDITIONS or FUNCTIONS:
    after every CONDITIONS or FUNCTIONS, put ; then {your CONDITIONS}
        e.g if distance < 2; {
            digitalwrite(leg, on). 
        }
CASE_SENSITIVITY:
    should not be CASE_SENSITIVITY
FUNCTIONS:
    CALL acts as import(python) or include(c++)
    call is also used to call a FUNCTIONS
    if, else, init remains the same
    